+     <title>Ivan Picó | Technical Project Manager</title>
+ 
+     <meta name="description"
+         content="Ivan Picó - Technical Project Manager leveraging AI-driven automation to streamline PM tasks, increase productivity, and design AI-powered workflows.">
+ 
+     <link rel="stylesheet"
